    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, take more zoloft to help me sleep? i thought i was supposed to take that exactly as prescribed. are you sure? i read online somewhere that mixing things can be risky. also is the dextromethorphan really totally fine with the sertraline? i'm a bit nervous about it.",
